UI instead of crashing the whole app. It's essential for a professional user experience."
19. How do you perform 'Debouncing' in a search bar?
"I use a timer (setTimeout) inside useEffect. The API call only triggers if the user stops typing for a set
duration (e.g., 500ms), which saves server resources and prevents excessive re-renders."
